# Token efficiency — perplexity inbox (workspace)

Global context rules: `~/.cursor/rules/token-efficiency.mdc`. Finish bar: `inbox-finish-and-testing.mdc`.

## Inbox-specific scope

- **Tests:** run targeted pytest only — `pytest tests/test_unified_sensor.py` (or the file you touched), not full estate sweeps
- **Brief format:** structured fields over narrative; status files use `{topic}__{kind}__vNN__YYYY-MM-DD__{seat}.md` with `[CLOSURE]` footer
- **Chat:** pointer only (path + subject) — full prose lives in inbox file + Vellum witness
- **Generated output:** never read/index `data/sensor_snapshot.json`, `completed-by-*/`, `archived/`, `.claude/compact-backups/`

